            // This test was not feasible due to limitations in Pex in detecting Assert.Fail
            int a = New_arrListIndexOfX;
            int b = Old_arrListCount;
        }                                                 
    }
}

This should work fine with other types as well (not just int).

Please note that this is an indirect contract test, as it is based on the behavior of the actual method (ArrayList.Contains), not on the code of the class in question.

I hope that helps,
Oren
    }
}  ﻿
